<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
	<title>Intel Resource and Design Center Registration Email Template</title>
	<meta charset="UTF-8">
	<style type ="text/css"> /* IE8 COMPENSATE FOR HTML5 COMPATIBILITY */ article, aside, figure, caption, figcaption, footer, header, main, nav, section, summary { display: block; } /* STRUCTURE */ body { -webkit-text-size-adjust: none; background-color:#f9f9f9; background: url('https://tstcqcontent-ssl.cps.intel.com/etc/designs/intel/us/en/images/gradiantbg-body.png') repeat-x scroll left top #f9f9f9; height: 100%; outline: medium none; } #container { /* "Container" contains all the layout code, sets page width in (pixels), and easily centers page. */ width: 600px; /* Good width of the vast majority of computer screens - 960px is standard because most users have 1024×768 resolution or higher */ margin-top: 10px; /* Outside the container line */ margin-right: auto; /* "auto" centers horizontally: tells the web browser to automatically calculate the space that is left over at the left and right of the #container */ margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: auto; /* "auto" centers horizontally: tells the web browser to automatically calculate the space that is left over at the left and right of the #container */ position: relative; /* "relative" because using things called floats */ /* position options {"relative", "absolute"} */ background-color: #FFFFFF; border-color: #E5E5E5; border-style: solid; padding: 25px 50px 0px 50px; /*top right bottom left -- Inside the container line */ border-width: 1px; overflow: hidden; line-height: 1.5em; } hr { background-color: #E5E5E5; color:#E5E5E5; border: 0 none; height: 1px; } img.floating { /* image with text around it */ float: right; padding: 4px 0px 0px 50px; /** top right bottom left **/ } /* TEXT STYLES */ body { font-family: "Intel Clear", Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-weight: normal; font-size: 10pt; color: #666666; } header { font-family: "Intel Clear Pro", Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1.1em; color: #003C71; line-height: 2em; } section { font-size: 0.8em; font-style: italic; color: black; line-height: 1.4em; } footer { font-size: 0.9em; line-height: 1.4em; } footer a { text-decoration: none; } a { color: #086DB6; } .intelBlueTextStyle { color: #086DB6; } .subjectTextStyle { font-size: 1.2em; font-weight: bold; color: #086DB6; line-height: 1.4em; } </style>
</head>


<body>
<div id="container"><header>
<h1><img src="https://messagecenter-cons.intel.com/v1/images/uploads/5104bda0-0fc2-11ec-901e-3750230d5760.png" alt="" title="devzone-premier-header_720x160@2x.png" width="700" height="156" /></h1>
<table style="background-color: #ffffff; margin: 0 0px; overflow: hidden; width: 460pt; line-height: 20px; border: 1px solid #E5E5E5;">
<tbody>
<tr style="height: 20px;">
<td colspan="2" id="emailMainDiv" style="font-family: 'Intel Clear', TAHOMA; padding-left: 50px; padding-top: 30px; height: 20px;">
<p style="margin-bottom: 0px; margin-top: 0px;"><b style="font-family: 'Intel Clear','TAHOMA'; color: #086db6; font-size: 10pt;">Hello {!Contact.Name},</b></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr id="emailBody" style="height: 152px;">
<td colspan="2" style="padding-left: 50px; padding-top: 15px; padding-right: 50px; height: 0px;">
<p style="margin-bottom: 0px; margin-top: 0px; font-family: 'Intel Clear','TAHOMA'; color: #666666; font-size: 10pt;">Thank you for your interest in Developer Zone Premier. After reviewing your application, it was determined that your project did not meet the requirements for a Developer Zone Premier account. We regret to inform you that your request for Premier access has been denied.
</p>
</td>
<tr>
<td colspan="2" style="padding-left: 50px; padding-top: 15px; padding-right: 50px; height: 0px;">
<p style="margin-bottom: 0px; margin-top: 0px; font-family: 'Intel Clear','TAHOMA'; color: #666666; font-size: 10pt;">You may continue to use your Standard account to access public content in the Developer Zone. If you feel your request was declined in error, please use the “Need Help?” link on our Developer Zone Premier registration form.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr style="height: 52.6667px;">
<td colspan="2" style="padding-left: 50px; padding-right: 110px; padding-top: 25px; line-height: 18px; height: 52.6667px;">
<p style="margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; font-family: 'Intel Clear','TAHOMA'; font-size: 7.5pt; color: #62686e;"><span style="font-family: calibri; font-size: 11pt;">Additionally, we have several resellers that you may wish to engage with for resource help with your project.  </span><span style="font-family: calibri; font-size: 11pt;">  </span></p>
<ul>
<li><span style="font-family: calibri; font-size: 11pt;"><em>Intel Solutions Document Library</em>: <a href="https://builders.intel.com/solutionslibrary">https://builders.intel.com/solutionslibrary</a></span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: calibri; font-size: 11pt;"><em>For product and pricing related questions, please contact your Motherboard OEM, Intel Authorized Distributors (IAD) or Intel Authorized Supplier (IAS). You can locate a list of IAD or IAS at: </em><a href="https://www.intel.com/content/www/us/en/partner/where-to-buy/overview.html">https://www.intel.com/content/www/us/en/partner/where-to-buy/overview.html</a></span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: calibri; font-size: 11pt;"><em>For Intel Programs information and support:</em><a href="https://www.intel.com/partner-alliance">https://www.intel.com/partner-alliance</a> </span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: calibri; font-size: 11pt;"><em>For product information:</em><u></u><a href="https://ark.intel.com/">https://ark.intel.com/</a> </span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: calibri; font-size: 11pt;"><em>Software &amp; Drivers download center:</em><strong></strong><a href="https://downloadcenter.intel.com/">https://downloadcenter.intel.com/</a> </span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: calibri; font-size: 11pt;"><em>Intel Community:</em><em></em><a href="https://community.intel.com/">https://community.intel.com/</a> </span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: calibri; font-size: 11pt;"><em>Intel Solutions Marketplace catalog:</em> <a href="https://marketplace.intel.com/">https://marketplace.intel.com/</a><a href="https://marketplace.intel.com/"></a></span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: calibri; font-size: 11pt;"><em>Intel Customer Support: </em><a href="https://www.intel.com/support">https://www.intel.com/support</a> </span></li>
</ul>
</td>
</tr>
<td colspan="2" style="padding-left: 50px; padding-top: 0px; padding-right: 50px;">
<p style="margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; font-family: 'Intel Clear','TAHOMA'; font-size: 7.5pt; color: #62686e;"><span style="font-family: calibri; font-size: 11pt;">We appreciate your patience and sincerely apologize if your request may have taken longer than usual to process.</span><span style="font-family: calibri; font-size: 11pt;">  </span></p>
<p style="margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; font-family: 'Intel Clear','TAHOMA'; font-size: 7.5pt; color: #62686e;"><span style="font-family: calibri; font-size: 11pt;">Thank you for your interest in Intel.</span><span style="font-family: calibri; font-size: 11pt;">  </span></p></td>
</tr>
<tr id="salutationDiv" style="padding-bottom: 5px; height: 52px;">
<td colspan="2" style="font-family: 'Intel Clear', TAHOMA; font-size: 10pt; color: #666666; padding-left: 50px; padding-top: 14px; line-height: 18px; height: 52px;">Kindest Regards, <br /> Intel Corporation</td>
</tr>
<tr style="height: 17px;">
<td colspan="2" style="padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px; padding-top: 15px; height: 17px;" align="center"><hr style="background-color: #e5e5e5; color: #e5e5e5; border: 0 none; height: 1px;" /></td>
</tr>
<tr id="emailFooter" style="height: 32px;">
<td style="padding-left: 50px; font-family: 'Intel Clear', TAHOMA; font-size: 9pt; line-height: 16px; color: #666666; padding-top: 13px; height: 32px;">Intel is committed to protecting your privacy. For more Information, <br /> please see the <a href="http://www.intel.com/content/www/us/en/privacy/intel-privacy-notice.html" style="font-family: 'Intel Clear','TAHOMA'; font-size: 9pt; text-decoration: none; color: #086db6 !important; outline: none;">Intel Privacy Notice.</a> <a href="http://www.intel.com/content/www/us/en/privacy/intel-cookie-notice.html" style="font-family: 'Intel Clear','TAHOMA'; font-size: 9pt; text-decoration: none; color: #086db6 !important; outline: none;">Intel Cookie Notice.</a></td>
<td rowspan="2" style="font-family: 'Intel Clear', TAHOMA; padding-top: 10px; height: 48px;">
<div style="margin-right: -20px;"><img hspace="0px;" src="http://www.intel.com/etc/designs/intel/us/en/images/myIntelLogo.jpg" height="62px" /></div>
</td>
</tr>
<tr id="emailFooter2" style="height: 16px;">
<td style="padding-left: 50px; font-family: 'Intel Clear', TAHOMA; font-size: 9pt; color: #666666; padding-top: 14px; line-height: 16px; height: 16px;"><a href="http://www.intel.com/content/www/us/en/legal/terms-of-use.html" style="font-family: 'Intel Clear','TAHOMA'; font-size: 9pt; text-decoration: none; color: #086db6 !important;">Legal Information</a> | <a href="http://www.intel.com/content/www/us/en/legal/trademarks.html" style="font-family: 'Intel Clear','TAHOMA'; font-size: 9pt; text-decoration: none; color: #086db6 !important; outline: none;">Trademarks</a> | <span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'Intel Clear','TAHOMA'; color: #666666;">©</span> <span style="font-family: 'Intel Clear','TAHOMA'; font-size: 9pt; color: #666666;">Intel Corporation.</span></td>
</tr>
<tr style="height: 10px;">
<td style="display: none; height: 10px;"> </td>
</tr>
<tr style="height: 53px;">
<td style="border: none; padding: 10.5pt 0.75pt 10.5pt 33pt; height: 53px;">
<p style="line-height: 15.0pt;"><span style="font-size: 11px;"> !%TemplateCode%! </span></p>
</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</body>
</html>